# Portainer Configuration
# Note: Admin password is set via the web UI on first run
# Portainer stores credentials in its internal database after initial setup
#
# Optional: To set password via CLI, generate bcrypt hash with:
# docker run --rm httpd:2.4-alpine htpasswd -nbB admin 'your-password' | cut -d ":" -f 2
# Then add to docker-compose.yaml command: --admin-password='$2y$05$...'
